<!--Q#8-->
<example><exercise>
  <problem>
    
    <para>Draw a number line, including a scale, so that the point marked with a circle represents the solution to the inequality: \( 7.50h + \frac {50}{4}h &gt; 18h + 33 \).
        <figure><media alt="A blank number line is shown with an open circle on a point in the middle.&#10;        "><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/3ab9d6c1efc50cac2d8c8e66fde938a8366ee2ea"/></media></figure></para>
    <para>Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
  </problem><solution>
